Package: com.yaowell.batterymirrorlite
Name: BatteryMirror Lite
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: 将状态栏电池图标镜像显示在控制中心低电量开关上（基于 futur3sn0w 开源项目，按个人喜好修改了部分效果并去除设置项） Mirrors the statusbar battery on the Low Power Mode toggle in Control Center.
Maintainer: yaowell
Author: yaowell, futur3sn0w
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate
